{"text": "# Relocation file: Zubeldia family — Bilbao → Eindhoven\n\n**Case** ELS-2025-0718 · consultant Annelies van der Heijden (Expat Landing Services) · a.vanderheijden@expatlanding.example · +31 40 555 0142\n**Employer** Brabant Photonics B.V., start date 1 december 2025, gross salary € 78.400 per year, relocation allowance € 7.500,00\n\n## The family\n\n| | Name | Born | Passport / DNI | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Employee | Íñigo Zubeldia Aramburu | 14-03-1983 | DNI 44718820-K, passport PAK441872 | optical engineer |\n| Spouse | Maite Larrañaga Otxoa | 02-11-1985 | DNI 72093316-T | physiotherapist; Dutch BIG registration not started |\n| Child | Ane | 2015 | passport PAL207719 | type 1 diabetes, insulin pump |\n| Child | Unai | 2019 | on mother's Libro de Familia | — |\n\n## Done\n\n- [x] Rental signed 2025-10-28: Kruisstraat 118-B, 5612 CL Eindhoven. Rent € 2.150 p/m, deposit two months.\n- [x] BRP registration appointment at the gemeente: woensdag 3 december, 09:20. Bring apostilled birth certificates for Ane Zubeldia Larrañaga and Unai Zubeldia Larrañaga.\n- [x] BSN for Íñigo issued on his earlier short stay: 218440917.\n- [x] School: Internationale School Kempen, places confirmed for both children; fees € 6.900 each, employer pays half.\n\n## Still open\n\n- [ ] 30%-regeling application. Needs the signed addendum and proof he lived more than 150 km from the border. Old address: Calle Licenciado Poza 44, 3º Izda., 48011 Bilbao, Bizkaia.\n- [ ] Dutch bank account. Until then salary goes to the Spanish account at Kutxa Nervión: IBAN ES16 2191 2410 3273 1773 1932, BIC KUNEES2BXXX.\n- [ ] Spanish tax: file Modelo 030 for change of address; NIF is the DNI. Ask HR for the A1 certificate for November.\n- [ ] Health insurance within four months of registration. Ane's endocrinologist in Bilbao will write a summary in English; ask the insurer about pump supplies. Maite asked whether her treatment for postnatal depression has to be declared: no, basic cover has no medical questions.\n- [ ] DigiD. Applied 12 nov; activation letter goes to Kruisstraat. He chose user name izubeldia83.\n- [ ] Car: Spanish plates 4418 LKM must be re-registered or exported within the exemption period.\n\n## Contact\n\nÍñigo: +34 655 550 147, inigo.zubeldia@correovasco.example. Maite: 655 55 01 82 (WhatsApp). They speak Basque at home; emails in English or Spanish are fine. *Eskerrik asko* to Annelies from the family.", "kind": "Markdown document", "detail": "398 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Annelies van der Heijden", "Íñigo Zubeldia Aramburu", "Maite Larrañaga Otxoa", "Ane", "Unai", "Íñigo", "Maite", "Annelies"], "companies": ["Expat Landing Services", "Brabant Photonics B.V.", "Kruisstraat", "Kutxa Nervión"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Bilbao", "Eindhoven", "Kruisstraat 118-B", "Bizkaia", "Kruisstraat"], "health": ["diabetes", "insulin pump", "endocrinologist", "postnatal depression", "treatment"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Íñigo", "Maite", "Ane", "Unai", "Annelies"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.20000000298023224, "modelMs": 22024.39999999851, "topicMs": 26839.60000000149, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 19, "end": 27, "text": "Zubeldia", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Zubeldia Aramburu"}, {"start": 37, "end": 43, "text": "Bilbao", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Bilbao"}, {"start": 46, "end": 55, "text": "Eindhoven", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Eindhoven"}, {"start": 66, "end": 79, "text": "ELS-2025-0718", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "ELS-2025-0718"}, {"start": 93, "end": 117, "text": "Annelies van der Heij